	<object class="Event" id="{083d24f7-28b1-4765-a9f4-c80da9b6a07b}">
		<property name="note">
			<value>One leaf of the stream's flush wooden double door swinging open, 0 -&gt; 88 deg in 0.9 s on a smoothstep (still at both ends, fastest at 0.45 s). One instance per leaf at the leaf's centre. Swing = a whole recorded swing (843829), Lead / Follow from disjoint pools, Follow 28 ms late and 2 dB down: still muted, since 683823 (the door Red chose, 2026-10-22) has no swing bed and a heavy leaf is nearly silent while it moves. Release = the pair leaving its stop, the latch and push of 683823, once per pair (Lead only). No motor, no creak loop, nothing at rest. A pair renders about -42 LUFS (momentary max) at 3 m (FMOD NRT, 2026-10-22), about 4 dB under the player's damp carpet walk (-38).</value>
